  "description": "pqf is the command-line tool for the Post-Quantum File Format (PQF): a hybrid post-quantum (X25519+ML-KEM-768 / Ed25519+ML-DSA-87) encrypted file container using the X-Wing KEM combiner (draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem), with a deterministic CBOR header, fail-closed parser, and reference test vectors. EXPERIMENTAL preview; not externally audited; do not use to protect irreplaceable data.",
  "id": "PostQuantum.FileFormat.Cli",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-30T14:25:39.76Z",
