  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/systemslibrarian/PostQuantum.FileFormat",
  "published": "2026-05-30T14:23:00.917Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0-preview.2: wire-incompatible break from 0.5. KEM combiner switched from the in-house pqf1-bind-extract-v1 HKDF construction to X-Wing (draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem) with ML-KEM-768; both .NET and Rust impls validated against the X-Wing IETF draft Appendix C test vector; build target narrowed to net10.0 only and ML-KEM/ML-DSA come from the BCL native types directly (no reflection bridge). Full notes in CHANGELOG.md. EXPERIMENTAL; not externally audited.",
